    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Anthropologists wondered where the remote ancestors of the Polynesian peoples now living in the Pacific Islandscame from.",
      "translation": "人类学家想知道现在居住在太平洋群岛的波利尼西亚人的远祖是从哪里来的。",
      "startTime": 57.67,
      "endTime": 66.9,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Anthropologists",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "人类学家"
          },
          {
            "word": "Ancestors",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "祖先"
          },
          {
            "word": "Remote",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "遥远的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "The sagas of these people explain that some of them came from Indonesia about 2, 000 years ago.",
      "translation": "这些民族的传说解释说，他们中的一些人是在大约2000年前从印度尼西亚迁徙来的。",
      "startTime": 66.91,
      "endTime": 75.25,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Explain",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "解释"
          },
          {
            "word": "Indonesia",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "印度尼西亚"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "But the first people who were like ourselves lived so long ago that even their sagas, if they had any, are forgotten.",
      "translation": "但是，最早像我们这样的人类生活在很久以前，以至于即使他们有什么传说，也早已被遗忘了。",
      "startTime": 75.26,
      "endTime": 85.7,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Forgotten",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "被遗忘的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "So archaeologists have neither history nor legends to help them to find out where the first 'modern men' came from.",
      "translation": "因此，考古学家既没有历史也没有传说来帮助他们弄清最早的“现代人”是从哪里来的。",
      "startTime": 85.71,
      "endTime": 94.83,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Archaeologists",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "考古学家"
          },
          {
            "word": "Neither...nor...",
            "pos": "conj.",
            "meaning": "既不...也不..."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Fortunately, however, ancient men made tools of stone, especially flint,",
      "translation": "然而，幸运的是，古代人制造了石器，特别是燧石，",
      "startTime": 94.84,
      "endTime": 101.44,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Fortunately",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "幸运地"
